				\usepackage{upgreek}
				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$${{{{{\rm{TV}}}}}}(G({x}_{{{{{{\rm{input}}}}}}}))=\mathop{\sum}\limits_{p}\mathop{\sum}\limits _{q}{{{{{\rm{|}}}}}}{G({x}_{{{{{{\rm{input}}}}}}})}_{p+1,q}-{G({x}_{{{{{{\rm{input}}}}}}})}_{p,q}{{{{{\rm{|}}}}}}+{{{{{\rm{|}}}}}}{G({x}_{{{{{{\rm{input}}}}}}})}_{p,q+1}-{G({x}_{{{{{{\rm{input}}}}}}})}_{p,q}{{{{{\rm{|}}}}}}$$\end{document}TV(G(xinput))=∑p∑q∣G(xinput)p+1,q−G(xinput)p,q∣+∣G(xinput)p,q+1−G(xinput)p,q∣

The discriminator network has a separate loss function which is defined as:4\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
